    "category": "Recursion",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "There are N people standing in a circle numbered from 1 to N. Starting from the first person, every K-th remaining person is eliminated until only one person remains. Solve the problem recursively and return the position of the survivor.",
